{
  "name": "08 – Envoi depuis le CRM (Gmail pro)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📤 08 – Envoi depuis le CRM\n\nQuand tu cliques **Envoyer** dans le CRM (page Messages ou fiche), le CRM appelle ce webhook et l'email part **depuis ton Gmail pro**. Si c'est une réponse, elle part dans la même conversation.\n\nUne fois activé : copie la **Production URL** du nœud 1 dans Vercel → variable `N8N_MAIL_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n\nFilet de sécurité : du lundi au vendredi, toutes les heures, il renvoie les emails restés en attente.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "97534dff-3419-43b7-ba0c-b19db9bc5653",
      "name": "Note -520--420"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔑 Connexions\n- **CRM x-api-key** : nœuds 1, 2, et les deux « CRM »\n- **Gmail pro** : les deux nœuds Gmail",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "2bfc2dc2-877b-480c-81b1-4600adbeb925",
      "name": "Note 440--420"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-envoi-email",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ],
      "id": "456c2ceb-f1a7-4fae-b33d-ca360dc80487",
      "name": "1. Ordre du CRM (webhook)",
      "webhookId": "597f4705-49a4-4403-ab67-9cf02596fe8d",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8-19 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        220
      ],
      "id": "86352831-5fca-4ce1-bc0a-e78ef8f4b079",
      "name": "Toutes les heures (lun-ven)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://crm-prospection-eight.vercel.app/api/n8n/messages?send_status=a_envoyer&direction=sortant&limit=20",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        220
      ],
      "id": "d736c941-4b05-44a4-8c3f-8f07943d9a27",
      "name": "2. Emails en attente (CRM)",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ordre reçu du CRM : on garde seulement ce qui sert à l'envoi.\nconst b = $json.body ?? {};\nif (b.action !== 'envoyer_email') return [];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  message_id: b.message_id, to: b.to, subject: b.subject || '(sans objet)', body: b.body || '',\n  reply_to_external_id: b.reply_to_external_id || null,\n} }];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "id": "1130e67e-1b2c-42a6-aaf0-f4e7880eecff",
      "name": "Lire l'ordre"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filet de sécurité : emails écrits dans le CRM depuis plus de 10 min et pas encore partis.\nconst limit = Date.now() - 10 * 60 * 1000;\nreturn ($json.messages ?? [])\n  .filter((m) => m.direction === 'sortant' && new Date(m.created_at).getTime() < limit)\n  .map((m) => ({ json: {\n    message_id: m.id, to: m.to_email, subject: m.subject || '(sans objet)', body: m.body || '',\n    reply_to_external_id: m.metadata?.reply_to_external_id || null,\n  } }));\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        220
      ],
      "id": "63756d74-02e5-40c7-83e9-ba6a7f8c4f18",
      "name": "Garder les oubliés"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "return { json: $json };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        100
      ],
      "id": "76852b4a-96f6-441d-8199-c4fc12a35f5b",
      "name": "Email à envoyer"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "9e56f17b-c2dc-4556-bfee-213b0217d469",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.reply_to_external_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        100
      ],
      "id": "2a8010a4-312f-46eb-97d8-e2a20897368a",
      "name": "C'est une réponse ?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "reply",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.reply_to_external_id }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "replyToSenderOnly": true
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d026a74d-1a71-4bf8-b8d0-ddc9c522638c",
      "name": "Gmail : répondre",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "Gmail pro"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        600,
        220
      ],
      "id": "c7f44aed-ef58-4d33-9104-08e30054f892",
      "name": "Gmail : nouvel email",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "Gmail pro"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://crm-prospection-eight.vercel.app/api/n8n/messages/{{ $('Email à envoyer').item.json.message_id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ send_status: 'envoye', external_id: $json.id, thread_id: $json.threadId }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
